{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23365","headline":"对镜吟 · 白居易","name":"对镜吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白头老人照镜时，掩镜沈吟吟旧诗。\n二十年前一茎白，如今变作满头丝。\n吟罢回头索杯酒，醉来屈指数亲知。\n老於我者多穷贱，设使身存寒且饥。\n少於我者半爲土，墓树已抽三五枝。\n我今幸得见头白，禄俸不薄官不卑。\n眼前有酒心无苦，只合欢娱不合悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23365.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23365","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}